{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_069E20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"沿加勒比海岸部署新型核武器，在中美洲建立坚固的核威慑……这就是Peace Walker计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"同时，这也是那种新型核武器的名称。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"给核武器取名叫<R=和平,PEACE>吗。都能想象Kaz叹气的样子了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=和平,PEACE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"话说回来，那种核武器为什么需要腿？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这就是它被称为“Walker”的原因。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"能靠自身移动，并从任何地点发射报复性核打击的无人兵器……这就是Peace Walker存在的意义。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""}]}